# ARKLinux package names — resolved from the pinned Arch 2026.07.15 snapshot
# Snapshot advanced: 2026-07-16 after the former snapshot failed current
# Arch keyring validation. Exact resolved versions are captured after build.
# Mirror: https://archive.archlinux.org/repos/2026/07/15/$repo/os/$arch
# To regenerate this list against a new snapshot:
#   ./build/scripts/pin-packages.sh <YYYY/MM/DD>

